# Author: ahui. Source uses UTF-8 without BOM and LF on every development host.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.onnx binary
*.ecglesson binary
# Reviewed third-party/resource hashes refer to exact bytes, including upstream EOL.
/resources/** -text -whitespace
